INSERT INTO customers VALUES(1,'user@example.com','2026-09-24');
CREATE INDEX idx_customers_email ON customers(email);
```

Before adding an index, identify the query, expected selectivity, write workload and existing keys. Compare plans and measured work on representative data. Do not infer production latency from a one-row fixture. The following count only checks that the explicitly inserted fixture is present.

